Third-party components shipped inside this plugin

No third-party code ships inside this plugin. The pw-discovery skill's script,
skills/pw-discovery/scripts/kb_tool.py, uses only Python's standard library,
and the discovery map uses only the browser's own JSON reader.

Earlier versions shipped js-yaml 4.1.0 (https://github.com/nodeca/js-yaml,
MIT, Copyright (C) 2011-2015 by Vitaly Puzrin) as
skills/pw-discovery/assets/js-yaml.js, and inlined it in every
discovery-map.html they wrote. Maps made by those versions still carry it,
with its license header.
